    "text": "Nickel <math> <mrow> <mtext>(Z</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>=</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>28)</mtext></mrow> </math> combines with a uninegative&nbsp;monodentate ligand to form a diamagnetic complex <math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"> <mrow> <msub> <mrow> <mtext>NiL</mtext></mrow> <mtext>4</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mrow> <mtext>2</mtext><mo>−</mo></mrow> </msup> <mo>.</mo></mrow> </math> The hybridisation involved and the number of unpaired electrons present in the complex are respectively:",
